        "name": "Phenomenal Evil Power",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Veigar is the greatest Evil to ever strike at the hearts of Runeterra - and he's only getting bigger! Striking an enemy Champion with a spell or scoring a takedown grants Veigar permanently increased Ability Power.",
